  description="What DJ Welker can build — brand, web, software, automation, growth, and operations. Grouped by outcome: Build, Connect, Automate, Run."
  current="services"
>
<main id="main">

<header class="case-head"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="k">Services &amp; skills</div>
  <h1>What I can do.</h1>
  <p class="tag">The range I work across — brand, web, software, automation, growth, and operations. Organized by outcome, not a random menu. Everything works together, and you own the result. Every skill here shows up in real projects.</p>
</div></header>

<!-- BY OUTCOME -->
<section class="csec"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="caps">
    <div class="cap"><div class="n">Outcome 01 · Build</div><h3>Make it look established</h3><ul><li>Brand identity &amp; systems</li><li>Logo &amp; identity design</li><li>Websites, landing pages, redesigns</li><li>Graphic design &amp; templates</li><li>Menus &amp; print packs</li><li>Content systems</li></ul></div>
    <div class="cap"><div class="n">Outcome 02 · Connect / Automate</div><h3>Make the experience work</h3><ul><li>Web apps &amp; internal tools</li><li>Booking + deposit systems</li><li>E-commerce stores</li><li>CRM, forms, calendars, payments</li><li>Email + SMS follow-up flows</li><li>Client / employee portals</li></ul></div>
