  </div>
  <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px">Four pillars, one operation: Build · Connect · Automate · Run. Free mockup first · plain-English agreement · one builder start to finish · you own it.</p>
</div></section>

<!-- FULL MATRIX -->
<section class="csec"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>The full capability matrix</h2>
  <p>Everything below is work I actually do — pulled straight from what I build for clients and my own products.</p>
  <div class="feat" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)">
    <div class="f"><div class="n">01 · Brand &amp; Creative</div><h4>Look like real money</h4><p>Logo + full brand identity · graphic design &amp; templates · menu + print packs · short-form video &amp; reels · content systems · pitch decks &amp; one-pagers.</p></div>
    <div class="f"><div class="n">02 · Web &amp; Software</div><h4>Sites, apps, systems</h4><p>Websites, landing pages, redesigns · web apps &amp; internal tools · client / employee portals · e-commerce stores · booking + deposit systems · business operating systems.</p></div>
    <div class="f"><div class="n">03 · Automation &amp; AI</div><h4>The busywork, gone</h4><p>Business &amp; workflow automation · CRM automation &amp; pipelines · email + SMS follow-up flows · proposal / quote automation · AI chatbot / receptionist · reporting that builds itself.</p></div>
    <div class="f"><div class="n">04 · Growth &amp; Marketing</div><h4>Get found &amp; booked</h4><p>Local SEO + Google Business · review generation engine · social content + management · email / SMS marketing · paid social ads · landing pages + funnels.</p></div>
    <div class="f"><div class="n">05 · E-commerce &amp; Resale</div><h4>Move product</h4><p>Shopify storefronts · product + listing systems · Depop / Grailed / eBay resale · Klaviyo email flows · dropship ops dashboards.</p></div>
